Description: VeltOS Clock, in the layout of Windows 11's Clock app
 Alarms (time, name, repeat days, snooze), timers with a progress ring,
 a stopwatch with laps, a world clock with the time in other cities and
 focus sessions that quiet notifications, in English and Turkish.
 .
 A small background agent (veltos-clock-agent, started with the session)
 rings alarms and finished timers while the app is closed: a notification
 with Snooze and Dismiss and the VeltOS alarm sound.
